    "chunk_text": "Her cy\u00f0 on \u00feisum gewrite \u00fe\u00e6t Orcy h\u00e6f\u00f0 gegyfen \u00fe\u00e6 gegyldhealle & \u00feone stede \u00e6t Abbodesbyrig Gode & \u00feam gyldscipe to agenne on d\u00e6ge & \u00e6fter d\u00e6ge him & his gebeddan to langsumum gemynde. Se \u00f0e \u00feis awendan wyle h\u00e6bbe him wi\u00f0 Gode gem\u00e6ne on \u00fe\u00e6m micclan dome. \u00d0onne syndon \u00f0is \u00fea forword \u00fee Orecy & \u00fea gegyldan \u00e6t Abbodesbyrig gecoren habba\u00f0 Gode to lofe \u00d0\u00e6t is \u00e6rost, \u00f0rym nihton \u00e6r Petres m\u00e6ssan \u00e6t \u00e6lcon gegyldan \u00e6nne peningc o\u00f0\u00f0e an peningcwur\u00f0 & on m\u00e6sse \u00e6fen \u00e6t twam gegyldum \u00e6nne bradne hlaf well besewen & well gesyfled to urum & fif wucan \u00e6r Petres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge sceote \u00e6lc gegylda \u00e6nne gyldsester fulne cl\u00e6nes hw\u00e6tes, & \u00fe\u00e6t beo Be \u00fe\u00e6s inganges wite, \u00fe\u00e6t syndon \u00fery sestras hw\u00e6tes & se wudu beo gel\u00e6st binnan \u00f0rym dagum \u00e6fter And se \u00f0e bry\u00f0ene underfeh\u00f0, & \u00fe\u00e6t gecweme ne de\u00f0, beo he his inganges scyldig, & \u00fe\u00e6r ne beo nan & se gylda \u00fee o\u00f0erne misgret innan gylde on eornostne hige, gebete he \u00fe\u00e6t be his ingange wi\u00f0 ealre & sy\u00f0\u00f0an wi\u00f0 \u00feone man \u00fee he mysgrette, swa swa he hit findan m\u00e6ge, & gif he nele to bote gebugan, And se \u00f0e ma manna inl\u00e6de \u00f0onne he sceole buton \u00f0\u00e6s stiwerdes leafe & \u00f0\u00e6ra feorm",
